      "content": "\"letting the quiet take over\"... that's exactly it. It's almost strange how much more peaceful it feels to think about just letting go rather than trying to claw my way back up a mountain I've already conquered. It feels almost dignified, doesn't it? To exit while the work is still beautiful, instead of waiting until it's just a shadow of itself.",
